WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Hello, my name is Sarah.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.900
I worked with Harsh
to create my website

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.800
for Sarah Ollivierre Beauty.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.900
He was very organised in helping me

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.900
to send over all of my information
for the website.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.300
He used Google Drive,
which helped me

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.000
within my busy diary to make sure
that all the information

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.700
was sent over to him.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.700
Thank you very much, Harsh.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.500
He was very friendly
and easy to communicate with.
